@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+# API Gateway (placeholder)
+
+This folder holds the API gateway configuration. The `nginx.conf` file is a minimal placeholder.
+
+The repository also includes a simple Node-based gateway skeleton (`src/index.js`) that enforces JWT auth
+and proxies requests to backend services. It's intended as a minimal replacement for local/dev environments
+and as a starting point for a production gateway.
+
+To use the Node gateway (development):
+
+1. Edit environment variables or set `USER_SERVICE_URL`, `CONTENT_SERVICE_URL`, `STORAGE_SERVICE_URL`.
+2. `cd services/api-gateway && npm install`
+3. `npm start`
+
+In production, consider using an API gateway (Kong/Traefik/API Management) or enhance this skeleton.
